Workflow:

1. User explicitly selects Deep Inspect.
2. Capture one still frame.
3. Show confirmation.
4. Send the still image to the centralized DRISHYAM backend.
5. Backend invokes configured vision provider.
6. Return candidate ingredients.
7. User verifies them.
8. Save confirmed items.

Never upload continuous video.

Never expose external vision API keys in the APK.

