Android:

- Room database.
- Local scanner.
- Offline pantry changes.
- Local meal logs.
- Operation outbox.
- WorkManager synchronization.
- Retry logic.

Website:

- Persistent backend data.
- Appropriate read caching.
- Clear network error states.
- Preservation of unsaved changes.

Use stable UUIDs, version tracking, timestamps, incremental synchronization and idempotency keys.

Do not blindly overwrite newer information.

Test concurrent changes.

